    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You master your breath and body, allowing your voice to shape your own form.</p><p><strong>Steadfast Voice.</strong> When you fail a saving throw, you can spend 1 Focus Point to add your Martial Arts die to the roll, potentially turning failure into success.</p><p><strong>Purifying Breath.</strong> At the start of your turn, you can spend 1 Focus Point to end one of the following conditions on yourself: Paralyzed or Stunned.</p><p><strong>Striking Word.</strong> When you use Voice of Authority, you can deal extra Force damage equal to one roll of your Martial Arts die if the target fails its saving throw.</p><ul><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.lyonesse.Item.33ee85240268b12f]{Steadfast Voice}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.lyonesse.Item.d91c7242b9614026]{Striking Word}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.lyonesse.Item.d89841bd11f0ec60]{Purifying Breath}</li></ul>"
    },
